# Trivy ignore list for the runtime SBOM gate.
#
# Spring Framework 6.2.19 (Spring Boot 3.5.x) has no OSS backport for the
# August/September 2026 MVC/WebFlux advisories; the only OSS fix is Spring
# Framework 7.0.9 (Spring Boot 4). None of the affected features are used by
# this codebase: no XsltView/JSP views, no Server-Sent Events, no
# versioned/static resource serving, no UrlHandlerFilter or
# UrlFileNameViewController, no JavaScriptUtils or JSP form tags, no
# functional (RouterFunction) endpoints, no multipart/file-upload handling
# and no server-side sessions (JWT bearer auth only).
# Tracked in BANK-<sec> until the Spring Boot 4 migration.
CVE-2026-47884
CVE-2026-47890
CVE-2026-47892
